window.products.push({"id":970054,"name":"LOVDDYUN Glass Mason Jar Regular Mouth with Lid and Band,12 oz,8-pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eMpVFWXtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❥【MULTIPURPOSE & DIY PRODUCTION】The mason jars with lids have multiple use. The main purpose of Vintage 12 oz mason jars is for canning and preserving food.The mason jars can be also used for the reusable container or water container in house and kitchen.What's more, you can even use them to do some craft or DIY projects as some gifts.You can paint and decorate the classic canning jars whatever you like and you can also use them to create party lights. ❥【PERFECT SUIT & PREMIUM QUALITY】Mason jars 12 oz is with 8-Packs.The body of canning jars is made of Food-grade soda-lime glass that resist cracking and breaking,and the mason jar lids is made of silver metal.The transparent design is easy to check the items of the jelly jar whether deteriorated or not，and these mason jars are easy to clean.(Attached:1 cleaning brush, 24 blackboard label stickers,1 Erasable chalk pen.) ❥【 BPA FREE & SEAL DESIGN 】 These glass mason jar are made of BPA free food safe grade glass.They are great waterproof and moisture-proof.The regular mouth canning lid and band are BPA Free as well.Each 12 oz canning jars comes with a airtight lid. Each jars with airtight lids is expertly designed with ease of use and storage security. High quality glass jars with lids aim at increasing the sealing performance and the great sealing effect. ❥【DURABILITY & CONVENIENCE】These jars are with smooth feel and bright transparency, making the glass look more gorgeous. While displaying the content, you can also keep the content in vivid colors, and you can check the item at any time.The mason jar with the attached lid is tightly sealed, which can be canned and sealed for up to 18 months.The mason jars are convenient to carry. They are small enough that allow you to put them in your bag.They are portable to be carried anywhere. ❥【 NOT APPLICABLE】We value our customers, and your shopping experience is vital for us. Since glass jars are fragile items, we have optimized the packaging to ensure the delivery safely. If you find anything goes wrong with the mason jar,please do not hesitate to contact with us.Not applicable: ovens, microwave ovens, ozone disinfection cabinets, flash heating equipment and do not put lids and straps in microwave ovens.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eMpVFWXtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LOVDDYUN","source_asin":"B08R87D8SM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-970054","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R87D8SM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R87D8SM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
