window.products.push({"id":970304,"name":"Eterish Yellow Table Cloth Round Table Cover Waterproof Embroidered Tablecloth Washable Dining Decorative for Holiday Home Christmas Party Picnic 70 i","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tfOZ7ZFKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About Eterish At Eterish, we CHERISH every moment with family and pets. Being together, any wonderful time is ETERNITY. Eterish aspires to offer more excellent solutions for the way you live with family members. Polyester fabric covered tables dramatically reduce stains transfer between patrons. Tablecloths are an easy way to make your customers feel at ease about placing their silverware on the table. Also, your staff will come in less contact with dirty tables, keeping them healthy and coming to work! HARD WEARING This versatile tablecloth is a perfect combination of waterproof, stain & dust resistant, wrinkle-free and won't fade, tear, or pill after repeated use. SPILLPROOF Keeps your table surface protected from spills and scratches. Spilled red wine on the table? No problem, just blot and wipe clean! RELAXED ELEGANCE Our line of premium tablecloths offers a chic, affordable flair for every holiday party or family dinner. To provide family and guests with a fresh feeling. Be it a festive family feast for the holidays, an upscale dinner party with your foodie friends, or just Sunday morning brunch, your tablescape should always be shining. Give it a fine foundation with this must-have tablecloth, a clean stage that's ready to be splashed with all of your decorating ideas. It is crafted if polyester poplin for a machine-washable design and it features a solid hue for added versatility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tfOZ7ZFKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eterish","source_asin":"B08HTPTG91","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-970304","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HTPTG91","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HTPTG91","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":970305,"name":"Villeroy & Boch Bernadotte Highball Glasses Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t4sWU-1nL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description This brilliantly cut wine goblet from Villeroy & Boch’s Bernadotte collection features intricate engraved detail that’s sure to elevate and complement any place setting. Features premium crystal glass that provides unparalleled shine, sparkle, and intricacy. This set of four 4.5” highball glasses comes securely packaged in an every-occasion-worthy gift box. Dishwasher safe construction (top rack, please!) leaves plenty of time for celebration with family and friends. About Us: Based in Germany, Villeroy & Boch is one of the largest producers of premium porcelain and ceramic products worldwide. Family-owned since 1748, Villeroy & Boch is an award-winning, innovative company rooted in a time-honored tradition. Over its 250+ year history Villeroy & Boch has become known as a trusted international lifestyle brand offering tabletop and sophisticated home décor products for your contemporary lifestyle. For generations, our dinnerware has graced the tables of crowned European royalty, and has been a staple in renowned hotels and restaurants on every continent. Amazon.com Familiar and always refreshing, Villeroy & Boch's Bernadotte glassware has a timeless appeal in casual settings and formal décors alike. This set of six highballs features tall, vertical cuts that begin at the very base of each glass and reach up to create a symmetrical arched pattern a bit below the upper rim. Crafted of full lead crystal, the glasses have a pleasantly weighty feel and sparkle brilliantly at sunny afternoon toasts or evening candlelight nightcaps. Their versatile size also makes them perfect for working overtime at the bar or in the kitchen. Imported from Europe, the glasses stand 6 inches tall and go safely into the dishwasher. Add them to the full Bernadotte barware collection for a classic, always-in-style collection. --Kara Karll","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t4sWU-1nL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Villeroy & Boch","source_asin":"B073H13GFS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-970305","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073H13GFS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073H13GFS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
