window.products.push({"id":970397,"name":"Kardiel Nissen & Gehl Style Mid-Century Modern AK-1340 Desk, Walnut Wood","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518jENquS5L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Whether digitally creating or exploring the art of Calligraphy indulge your inspirations with this Architecturally stunning modernism design. Abundant surface space for laptop to full screen monitors alike. The simple, modernism design of Ak-1340 provides a relatively thin flat rectangular working table seemingly floating over two stainless steel rectangular base legs. Rising from the floor, the legs protrude into the body of the desk creating natural separation between 4 ample space dovetail drawers. A brilliantly finished, period correct, durable North American Walnut Wood veneer wraps the body. * Construction Materials: Walnut Wood Veneer; Chromed Stainless Steel * True to original: Four (4) symmetrical storage drawers * True to original: Lineal low profile drawer handles * True to original: Polished Stainless Steel legs * Feature: Pull out drawers on smooth glides * Feature: Four (4) attached floor protectors * Dimensions: 74.8\" Width x 28.75\" Depth x 28.3\" Height * Assembly: Some assembly required The inherent nature of solid and real wood veneers mean that wood grain and color may vary. Inconsistencies should be expected and appreciated.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518jENquS5L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kardiel","source_asin":"B00TEOZ1PW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-970397","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00TEOZ1PW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00TEOZ1PW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
