window.products.push({"id":970410,"name":"NutriChef Wine Dispenser, Automatic Electric Wine Aerator Pourer w/ Metal Decanter Spout for Red and White Wine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":51.86,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UCCIgiXtL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"NutriChef Model : PSLWPMP50 Electric Wine Pump Aerator Dispenser Electric Wine Aerator Dispenser Pump - Portable and Automatic Bottle Breather Tap Machine - Air Decanter Diffuser System for Red and White Wine w/ Unique Metal Pourer Spout - NutriChef PSLWPMP50 Features: Electric Wine Aerator Pump and Decanter Electric Wine Aerator Pump and Decanter Keep Your Wine Fresher, Longer! Keep Your Wine Fresher, Longer! Portable and Automatic Wine Dispenser Portable and Automatic Wine Dispenser Simple & Hassle-Free One-Button Operation Simple & Hassle-Free One-Button Operation Universal Fit Attaches to All Wine Bottle Types Universal Fit Attaches to All Wine Bottle Types Air-Tight Bottle Fit Design Keeps Wine Aerated Air-Tight Bottle Fit Design Keeps Wine Aerated Easily Attaches / Detaches Easily Attaches / Detaches Convenient Battery Operated Design Convenient Battery Operated Design Unique Non-Splash, No-Mess Metal Spout Unique Non-Splash, No-Mess Metal Spout Technical Specs: Construction Material: Engineered ABS Construction Material: Engineered ABS Battery Operated Requires (6) x ‘AAA’ Batteries, Not Included Battery Operated Requires (6) x ‘AAA’ Batteries, Not Included Total Aerator Dimensions (L x W x H): 2.40’’ x 2.40’’ x 6.40’’–inches（without Spout) Total Aerator Dimensions (L x W x H): 2.40’’ x 2.40’’ x 6.40’’–inches（without Spout) NutriChef’s PSLWPMP50 provides an easy to use solution for professional and simple wine aeration and dispensing. Why aerate your wine? Wine is made up of hundreds of compounds, and with aeration, usually the volatile undesirable compounds will evaporate faster than the desirable, aromatic and flavorful ones. Aeration reduces compounds like sulfites, which are added to wine to prevent oxidation and bacteria. It also will help to reduce any strong hints of Ethanol allowing the flavors to better express themselves. The wine tap attaches to the top of any glass wine bottle with an air tight seal protecting the wine’s freshness and allows for a classy and convenient way to serve properly aerated wine. Use either the solid or flexible straw to pump wine from the bottom of any size wine bottle. PSLWPMP50 requires 4 AA batteries (Not Included)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UCCIgiXtL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NutriChef","source_asin":"B01N1ERC0J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-970410","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N1ERC0J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N1ERC0J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
