window.products.push({"id":970423,"name":"Elimeta Soap Holder Container with Draining Tray, Soap Dish Box for Shower Bathtub Kitchen Bathroom Home (2Pcs Grey)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51axc1+jQ7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Keeps clean and tidy: This handy and pliable silicone soap dish self drains, the soap will stay dry and fresh because water drains easily from the tray. It is also large enough for any of the bar soaps that use. Use comfortable and friendly: The silicone soap dish will not stick too tightly with your soap and soap does not slide off. It can keep the soap dry and the mushy can be rinsed clean easily. The soap holder is easy to position and does not slip around, even when wet. Functional and practical: This silicone soap case is designed to perch on the edge of your sink, letting excess water drain away and air flow freely around your bar of soap, extending its longevity. Flexible material: This soap dish is made of soft and flexible silicone, it fits on a variety of basins and any drips roll into the basin, perfect for your shower shelf, vanity or countertop, the texture makes it not slip, won’t break or smash everywhere. Versatile soap holders: The silicone soap dish works great in the shower, bathtub, counter top. It can hold soaps, keys, glasses, dish washing sponge etc. Perfect match your bathroom and kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51axc1+jQ7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elimeta","source_asin":"B082MVSD3C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-970423","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082MVSD3C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082MVSD3C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":970424,"name":"Home-X Spinning Remote Control and Media Organizer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710js0PvruL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you tired of losing remote controls, notepads, memos, and more? Do you wish there was some way to save space, organize your items, and add a modern accessory to your home decor? Then this remote control and media organizer was made for you! With 5 separate compartments, this caddy provides the organization you need to keep track of hard-to-lose items like remote controls, pens, jewelry, and more. You can easily access any of the items you store in this caddy because it rotates 360 degrees. Now you don’t have to root around in jumbled boxes full of loose items; you can organize your items and always have them within reach. It’s made from high-density boards and high-quality black faux leather. With matching black stitching, the caddy has a modern, sleek look that complements any home or office decor. Faux leather is very easy to clean and keep clean. Simply use a wet rag, paper towel, or disinfectant wipe to remove dirt and dust. You can use this caddy to hold nearly anything: memos, notepads, pencils, pens, phones, snacks — the list goes on. Because of its space-saving design, you can place it on tables, desks, or bedsides without taking up too much room. By compiling all of your loose items into organized compartments, you can save space, prevent clutter, and stop losing items. With this caddy, you can feel comfortable hosting friends and family in your tidy, organized home. The Home-X Spinning Remote Control and Media Organizer is the solution to your organization, clutter, and storage problems.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710js0PvruL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B0811RC8ZN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-970424","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0811RC8ZN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0811RC8ZN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
