window.products.push({"id":970454,"name":"Scott Living Luxe Glass and Metal Cube Vase, 7 inch, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fPZ644R5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Scott Living is a reflection of our own personal style inspired by what we hold dear: home, family, and a commitment to quality. We believe luxury should be accessible to everyone. Our design philosophy blends heirloom industrial and modern aesthetics that allow us to focus on interesting materials, textures, finishes, and colors to create unique signature looks. This Scott Living Metal & Glass Cube Vase adds a new dimension to how you display faux or dried flowers. The metal frame has a modern, black finish and the glass container is suspended within the cube, so your floral display will seem to be floating on air. Not for use with real flowers; do not fill with water. Measures 6-1/2 x 3-3/4 x 3-3/4 inches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fPZ644R5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Scott Living","source_asin":"B081ZTZSWX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-970454","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081ZTZSWX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081ZTZSWX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":970455,"name":"Honey-Can-Do BTS-01587 Back To School Home Organization Kit, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RkYFVtYyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Honey-Can-Do BTS-01587 Back To School Home Organization Kit, Blue. Eight piece kit solves your organizing problems. Shoe rack keeps shoes organized and out of sight. Eight-shelf organizer comes with four storage drawers. Clothing hamper and laundry bag are perfect to organize laundry trips. Limited lifetime warranty. Amazon.com The Honey-Can-Do Dorm Organization Kit helps make your first home away from home a tidy, organized space you'll enjoy living in. This eight-piece kit supplies everything you need to keep your clothes, shoes, laundry, jewelry, and accessories from taking over your room. Each piece helps you make the most of your small space and is finished in white to complement any decorating scheme you dream up. And after you get your degree, use this kit in your apartment, condo, or house to keep your hard-earned possessions neat and organized. The Honey-Can-Do Dorm Organization Kit Offers: 8-piece system keeps your dorm room or home organized. 8-piece system keeps your dorm room or home organized. Over-the-door rack holds 24 shoes in see-through, wipe-clean pouches. Over-the-door rack holds 24 shoes in see-through, wipe-clean pouches. Mesh laundry bag and pop-up hamper manage dirty clothes. Mesh laundry bag and pop-up hamper manage dirty clothes. 8-shelf organizer keeps clothes easily accessible. 8-shelf organizer keeps clothes easily accessible. 4 drawers can be used with the shelf organizer or as stand-alone units 4 drawers can be used with the shelf organizer or as stand-alone units Save space with these hanging racks. This eight-piece kit helps you keep your dorm room or home organized. View larger . Eight-Piece Kit Solves All Your Organization Problems For many college students, living in a dorm means desperately trying to cram essentials into a shared space that's barely big enough for one person. Having a roommate and being part of a dorm community can be great for your social life, but it demands careful organization. With this all-inclusive kit, you'll get a place for everything without cluttering up your space, whether its a dorm room, apartment, den, or guest room. Over-the-Door Shoe Rack Holds 12 Pairs of Shoes First, a 20-inch by 57-inch shoe rack hangs over any traditional closet door to keep 12 pairs of shoes organized, off the floor, and out of sight. Complete with durable nylon pouches, this rack is made of sturdy polyester that holds up over time. You can even store jewelry, scarves, gloves, or small electronic items in the pouches. And to make things easy, the pouches wipe clean in seconds and are see-through so you can quickly find what you're looking for. Laundry Bag and Pop-Up Hamper Put Laundry in Its Place A mesh laundry bag and a medium-sized pop-up hamper help you organize your dirty clothes without having to look at them every day. It's likely you'll be regularly stuffing your hamper to the brim, so it measures a generous 19 inches by 14 inches and has a spiral steel frame for support. At the same time, however, the hamper is compact enough to be easily closed and stored in a small space, such as a corner or closet. When you finally get around to washing your clothes, the lightweight and sturdy laundry bag with drawstring will get you to the laundry room without spilling any garments along the way. Eight-Shelf Hanging System Holds Everything from Sweaters to Socks To help keep your clothes easily accessible, an eight-shelf hanging organizer offers endless possibilities. Keep bulky sweaters and jackets on one shelf, socks, hosiery, or ties on another, and use the remaining shelves to hold pants, shirts, and accessories, such as hats or scarves. For items that require a bit more care--such as dresses, blouses, or sports jackets--there are four storage drawers that can be used as stand-alone units or can be fitted into the shelves. A pop-up hamper and laundry bag help keep your laundry organized. Put your clean, folded clothes in the four storage drawers, which can be used with the shelf organizer or as stand-alone units. You can trust the items in the Dorm Organization Kit to stand up to wear and tear through your senior year and beyond, all the way to your first apartment, condo, or house. In fact, Honey-Can-Do offers a limited lifetime warranty on every product in the kit. What's in the Box One over-the-door, 12-pair shoe rack; one mesh laundry bag; one medium mesh pop-up hamper; and one eight-shelf hanging organizer with four storage drawers. From the Manufacturer Honey-Can-Do BTS-01584 Closet/Dorm Organization Kit comes with a shoe organizer, closet organizer, laundry bag and clothing hamper. Honey-Can-Do has created an amazing 8-piece home and room organizer, perfect for all you organizational needs. It comes with one over-the-door 12 pair shoe rack, one mesh pop-up hamper, one large laundry bag, one hanging closet organizer with eight shelves and four storage drawers to add versatility to the closet organizer. The shoe organizer has 24 clear pocke","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RkYFVtYyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Honey-Can-Do","source_asin":"B00KH6ZOVM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-970455","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KH6ZOVM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KH6ZOVM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
