window.products.push({"id":970551,"name":"Bosch TAS2002UC8 Tassimo T20 Beverage System and Coffee Brewer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719knkdnmPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The cafe experience in a stylish, compact system. The Bosch T20 Home Brewing System is designed with an eco-friendly, on-demand water heater for fast brewing. It's easy, too; just pop in a T DISC, and the T20 reads the barcode and brews the perfect cup of coffee, cappuccino, latte, espresso, tea, or any one of our coffeehouse style beverages. Bar code technology allows the TASSIMO machine to prepare each beverage with the exact pressure, temperature, water, and time duration, so each and every drink is perfect Additional Features: • Height adjustment and removable cup stand allows you to use the cup or travel mug of your choice • Automatic cleaning and descaling with use of a special T DISC keeps your beverages tasting clean • Removable cup stand and splash cover lets you customize the color to suit your kitchen","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719knkdnmPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tassimo","source_asin":"B007OQF5YE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-970551","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007OQF5YE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007OQF5YE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
