window.products.push({"id":970556,"name":"Gourmia GPM9980 – Pasta Maker, Roller and Cutter - Manual Hand Crank – Slices Dough into Spaghetti and Fettuccine – Stainless Steel Surface and Chrome","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811-tYVA+5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Calling all chefs around the world! Whether you're a rookie cook or an hard-boiled veteran, Gourmia introduces the Pasta Maker! A new way to create delicious, fresh pasta right at home! Nothing beats the taste of food made straight from scratch. Although store bought pasta is great, the satisfaction you get from creating a delicious meal from the start is unbeatable. With your own Pasta Maker, you will unleash your inner professional cook! PRODUCT FEATURES Stainless Steel Surface, Steel Chrome Plated Roller and Cutter Manually Operated Crank Durable Material for Long Lasting Utility Fettucine or Spaghetti Width Easy Maintenance with Brush or Wooden Rod - Do Not Apply Water! DELICIOUS HOMEMADE MEALS Have great tasting, gourmet quality pasta in the comfort of your home doesn't have to be difficult or expensive at all. With Gourmia , getting excellent meals for breakfast, lunch, and dinner is a cinch. Our Pasta Maker is the perfect device to deliver you and your family with freshly made pasta just the way you want it! Whether you're in the mood for lasagna, spaghetti, or linguine, our Pasta Maker will help you make finely cut noodles with the homemade taste that everyone loves. EASY TO USE MECHANISM Our machine comes in two parts: a roller and a cutter. Place your dough into the roller while turning the handle to flatten properly. Add flour and water to your mixture to make it pass easier to get the perfect shape you're looking for. A good mixture should never stick to your fingers so make sure you've got it just right so it doesn't stick to the device. Once rolled, attach the cutter onto the machine and insert the dough into the cutter. Turn the handle slowly as it passes through to get perfectly cut noodles. In just a few easy steps, you've got yourself delectable homemade pasta! Let Gourmia guide you into better tasting meals and get yourself the best pasta maker around!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811-tYVA+5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gourmia","source_asin":"B0779KPT4B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-970556","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0779KPT4B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0779KPT4B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
