window.products.push({"id":970567,"name":"Zoie + Chloe Stainless Steel Spaetzle Maker Lid with Scraper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81s12JC7H4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Spaetzle is a specialty noodle of mostly Southern German, Austrian, and Hungarian origin. Spaetzle is a delicious and easy to prepare recipe that will make a winning impression every time. Add finely chopped spinach to the dough for spinach spaetzle, or grated cheese for cheese spaetzle. You can also add butter, cinnamon, and sugar to the dough for a fabulous dessert. If you have not made spaetzle before this Scandicrafts Stainless Steel Spaetzle Noodle Maker is a great way to start. If you're already a spaetzle professional, this gadget is sure to make you noodle making even easier. This is a must have for every kitchen!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81s12JC7H4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zoie + Chloe","source_asin":"B01A59GXO2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-970567","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01A59GXO2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01A59GXO2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
