window.products.push({"id":970573,"name":"Cloth Napkins 100% Cotton Set of 6-20\" x 20\" Kitchen Napkins for Table Thanksgiving, Weddings, Home, Party, Holidays, Dinner, Weddings & Cocktail Part","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gWxo3M+TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cotton Imported HIGH QUALITY MATERIAL: Printed Patterns & 100% Premium Eco- Friendly Cotton Fabric with elegant designs, Size- 60\"x84''. Made to give you the holiday feel and to add charm to your table. Gives You The Most Pleasant Napkins Eclectic Mix of vibrant Are Printed and Designed to Mix and Match with Other Kitchen Linens Such As Napkins, Placemats, Table Cloth, Oven Mitts & Table Runners To Create The Perfect Home And Kitchen Ambience. WIDELY USE: This Napkins is perfect for kitchen dining room decoration or wedding reception table, party, banquet decorations. These Napkins are beautifully thin so that your plates and cutlery can lay elegantly flat avoiding bumpy tablecloths or even spilling drinks. BRIGHTEN YOUR SPECIAL DINNERS: Our Napkins offers a luxurious effect that is going to make your special moments even more memorable. Add this stunning Napkins to your table décor for an elegant and sophisticated look! PERFECT GIFT IDEAS: This Lovely & Creative Napkin with Pink Spring Fields design makes a perfect gift for every interior design enthusiast, It Can Become A Good Gift For Christmas, Birthday Party, Dinner, Daily Use, Mother's Day, Etc. WASH AND CARE INSTRUCTIONS: Machine Washable, Gentle wash, Use mild detergent, durable and long-lasting with daily use, Wash in Cold Water on Gentle Cycle & Tumble Dry Low, So many color options make coordination with kitchen accessories and dish towels easy and fun.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gWxo3M+TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Plush Home","source_asin":"B07DL32QJ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-970573","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DL32QJ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DL32QJ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":970574,"name":"Hug Feel The Love - Lightning Gnome - Stormy, Plush Gnome Decor, Swedish Gnome Ornament Tomte, Pocket Pal Gnomie Gift Figurine, 9 Inch Plush Doll","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OwfFCfARL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UNIQUE PERSONALITIES: Each gnome has a unique personality; Stormy the Lightning Gnome comes with a personalized hangtag with their name and charming favourite things. Collect all 25 Pocket Pals to complete the entire set! SOFT PLUSH: Whether commemorating a special occasion, celebrating that someone special in our life or just because it makes us happy, plush has been a go-to gift for folks young and young at heart. GOOD LUCK CHARM: The Swedish Tomte or Nisser has traditional roots in Scandinavia where it bestows good fortune and keeps away misfortune in the home. Hugs Gnomies are inspired by centuries of Gnome designs which have been used as symbols of good fortune throughout Europe. DOZENS OF DESIGNS: With over two dozen Pocket Pals we will always have the perfect gnome for any occasion. Whether it's Thanksgiving, Easter, Valentines Day, Christmas, Halloween and Birthdays, Hug Feel the Love Gnomies will have a gnome for you. CARE INSTRUCTIONS: The soft plush construction of the gnome means that cleaning can be done with a damp cloth. The Gnomies Pocket Pals are not machine washable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OwfFCfARL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hug Feel The Love","source_asin":"B09SGV4J8F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-970574","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SGV4J8F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SGV4J8F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
