window.products.push({"id":970608,"name":"Juicer Machines, Juilist New Generation Juicer Machines Vegetable and Fruit Easy to Clean, Compact Centrifugal Juicer Extractor with 3\" Wide Mouth and","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71evNoAK8lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥝【NEW GENERATION JUILIST】For an efficient and functional juicer, look no further than Juilist. Made of corrosion-resistant food-grade 304 stainless steel, this 400W juicer can produce juice in 8 seconds. It boasts sharp blades and a precision filter that allow less clogging and less foam through. The built-in foam separator of the juice barrel can separate the foam from the juice to ensure that the juice is smooth, providing an enjoyable and refreshing juice-drinking experience. 🥕【HIGH JUICE YIELD & NUTRIENTS】This juice extractor efficiently extracts vitamins and minerals, and can quickly produce juice in 8 seconds. With a powerful motor, sharp blade, and micro mesh filter, the Juilist produces 30% more silky juice and 40% more vitamins and minerals than other juicers Even compared to an 800W juicer, it doesn't fall short. This makes it easier for people to consume rich vitamins and minerals. 🍏【65mm WIDE FEED CHUTE & LARGE CAPACITY】If you're tired of prepping and repeatedly cleaning your juicer, the centrifugal Juilist is the one for you. Its 65mm (3 inches) wide mouth can save you time and effort on cutting. With a generous pitcher for storage, you can juice more foods at once without having to clean the pitcher in the middle of juicing. 🍊【TWO-SPEED MODE】The Juilist offers two-speed options to fit different fruits and vegetables. The \"Ⅰ\" low speed is designed for softer fruits such as oranges, while the \"Ⅱ\" fast speed is geared towards harder fruits like carrots, celery, and more. Selecting the appropriate speed for each type of fruit and vegetable can enhance the juice yield and flavor. To learn more, please refer to the user manual. 🥑【SAFE & EASY TO USE】The juicer features a rotary button with a light for easy one-step operation. The button light serves as an indicator to show that the juicer is working. Additionally, the safety locking arm ensures that the cover stays securely in place during use. Moreover, the juicer is equipped with an overheat protection feature that automatically shuts it off to prevent overheating and ensure your safety. Furthermore, the anti-slip base provides stability during juicing. 🍎【EASY TO CLEAN & ASSEMBLE】This juicer is a breeze to assemble, disassemble, operate, and clean. Its anti-drip design ensures that juice doesn't spill, and it even comes with a handy brush for effortless cleaning. Crafted from food-grade plastic and stainless steel, this juicer is not only safe to use but also easy to clean. 🍉【A Compact Health Assistant】This small-sized juicer is approximately half the size of regular juicers and occupies minimal space. Whether you want to use it daily or store it away easily, you can conveniently position it on your kitchen countertop. It's a health assistant that saves space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71evNoAK8lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Juilist","source_asin":"B09XB97HYW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-970608","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XB97HYW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XB97HYW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
