window.products.push({"id":970610,"name":"DEMDACO May Our Home Blue Stripe 7 x 5 Ceramic Stoneware Wood Decorative Recipe Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Xjl+sAk3L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"For more than 20 years, DEMDACO has designed and sold giftable products intended to “Lift the Spirit”—in times of celebration, when comfort is needed, or just to put a smile on someone’s face. The hand-curated artisan gifts it develops and distributes are chosen for their potential to help people nurture goodness in the lives of others, celebrate family and friends, and encourage people to treat themselves. We partner with artists representing a wide range of styles and mediums, and whose work is consistent with our values. Products are curated through this filter, then carefully reproduced by skilled craftspeople around the world. Under the DEMDACO brand, product categories include Gifts, Home Décor, Entertaining, Fashion, Baby, Holiday, and Outdoors. DEMDACO also maintains a partnership with artist Susan Lordi, offering her popular Willow Tree sculptures. May Our Home Recipe Box features a heartfelt sentiment that captures the warm and welcoming spirit of the kitchen as a gathering place for making memorable meals and traditions. Sentiment reads \"May our home overflow with warm memories and hearty laughter\". Recipe box is made of ceramic stoneware with a wood lid and 25 paper recipe cards included. Warm mango wood atop a ceramic recipe box imprinted with a short beautiful \"May Our Home\" blessing makes an heirloom quality gift. Recipe box measures approximately 6.5 x 5 inches. Store and organize all your favorite recipes. This trendy recipe box will not only make for an adorable surprise for your loved ones, but will also be treasured by them forever. Perfect gifts for friends and family who enjoy cooking and baking, or as a keepsake passed from one generation to the next. Perfect gift for housewarming, wedding, or bridal shower.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Xjl+sAk3L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DEMDACO","source_asin":"B0798L1DT3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-970610","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0798L1DT3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0798L1DT3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
