window.products.push({"id":970692,"name":"Deluxe Comfort Reading Pillow, Standard, Purple","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713QDuoNmiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lounge with ease with the Porter bedrest pillow! Do you spend lots of time lounging in bed? Do you enjoy reading your favorite novels or watching your favorite TV shows from beneath the covers? Are you a student that has endless hours of studying and homework to complete, and are tired of sitting at an uncomfortable desk? Whatever the reason for your extended periods of rest, staying in bed for long amounts of time can lead to pain in your neck and back. It's hard to get yourself in the right position, and ordinary pillows just don't seem to cut it. You need the Porter bedrest pillow, from Deluxe Comfort. Its plush support helps you sit upright in bed for lengthy periods of time without all the aches and pains you would normally experience. The pillow stands securely on its own, so it won't slouch or fall over when you get out of bed, or when you lean back on it. The thick \"arms\" of this pillow help to provide a stable base that aids in keeping the pillow upright. The arms also make an excellent place to rest your own arms while reading or watching television. Students of all ages will love this pillow, as it is the perfect size for smaller beds, and is easy to transport. The Porter bedrest pillow makes a pleasing addition to your lounging, and an excellent solution to your sore muscle issues. The microsuede cover is both soothing to the touch, and simple to take care of. It is available in five different colors, so you can choose the one that most matches your decor. These available colors include maroon, tan, purple, black, and dark brown.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713QDuoNmiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deluxe Comfort","source_asin":"B07CCFDXRL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-970692","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CCFDXRL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CCFDXRL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
