window.products.push({"id":970840,"name":"ANBUY 800CC Oxygen Absorbers for Food Storage 100 Count 1 Bag of 5 Packets Total 20 Individually Bags, Food Grade Oxygen Absorbers for Long Term Food ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8134bmD8EKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100 COUNT : Each pack of 5 absorbers comes pre-packaged in a factory vacuum-sealed pouch to reduce product exposure and waste. ELIMINATE THE EXCESS AIR : Works for mylar bags and meson jars, vacuum bags, and other airtight containers for long term food storage. VARIOUS SIZES ARE AVAILABLE : Your products deserve the highest quality oxygen scavengers on the market.An effective desiccant can save an entire bag of food. We have different models of oxygen absorbers for your choose. FOOD GRADE : Packet material is strictly tested for food purpose.Safe to be used with foods and pharmaceuticals storage.Oxygen absorbers designed primarily to prolong the shelf life of food, oxygen absorbers prevent the change of color in food products, stop oils in foods from becoming rancid. A COMMON MISCONCEPTION : Some people may think the Mylar bag will look \"Vacuum-Packed\" when the oxygen has been removed, if not, means the oxygen absorbers don't work. It's wrong. Oxygen absorbers only absorb oxygen, which is about 21% of air, so 1/5 of the air volume will be gone but 4/5 of the air remains no matter how many oxygen absorbers are used.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8134bmD8EKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ANBUY","source_asin":"B0B2DMNTSC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-970840","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2DMNTSC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2DMNTSC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
