window.products.push({"id":970969,"name":"CORKAS Executive Corkscrew,High-end Wine Opener with Premium Rosewood Handle,Double Worm Bottle Opener,Serrated Foil Cutter,Large-Sized Design,Bigger,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zRCIGbCSL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【High Quality and Lifetime Lasting Cork Screw】This sommelier inspired, reliable, high quality, and durable waiter wine opener could last for a lifetime. We designed this corkscrews for wine bottles to appeal to your inner sommelier. Once you use this wine corkscrew, this wine bottle opener will become your everyday go to for corking your wine. 【Larger-Sized Design Concept and Great Craftsmanship】Larger-sized design with labor-saving feature makes wine key for servers a high-end professional waiter's friend (Dimensions: 5.5*1.5*0.7 inches). Besides, we chose the highest quality mirror-polished steel to give this cork remover its sturdiness. and embedded wine openers with a sleek rosewood, giving the corkscrew an unmatched elegance as well as to meet the ergonomics design. A perfect display piece with great craftsmanship for wine lovers. 【Double Hinged Fulcrum & Corkscrew Wine Opener Design with Fine Tooth Blade】This wine key works better than any others waiters corkscrew that we've ever seen. The fluted pattern, two leverage arms, and double sided curve are design features that give the cork puller an unmatched ability to cleanly pull of even the longest corks. Additionally, the accompanying blade is equipped with a fine tooth that cuts incredibly smooth. 【Advanced Material and Classical Assembly Process】We doubled the material of other pocket corkscrews for a strong structure weighing at 8 oz with enhanced hand feeling. The Classical Assembly Process of wine opener manual is for a better joint flexibility and smooth using, which makes wine key for bartenders a big difference from the other pocket cork removers. 【Customer satisfaction is our top priority】If any reason you don't absolutely love this Corkscrew, please feel free to contact us through Amazon, We'd listen to you and bring you the best experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zRCIGbCSL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CORKAS","source_asin":"B088YRLL3Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-970969","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088YRLL3Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088YRLL3Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
